        {
          "number": 1,
          "method": "text",
          "quality": "usable",
          "text": "BIRCH | CONTRACT | POS uplink telemetry\n1.\nBirch POS uplink telemetry covers one packet-loss check each business day.\n2.\nISP contract changes are excluded from telemetry support.\n3.\nFor a high-severity POS uplink outage, the initial response target is 48\nminutes within branch support hours.\n"
        }
